# Plan backlog status (docs/plans)

When implementing/opening/updating a PR for work tracked in `docs/plans/`, update matching plan file(s) in that same PR.

## What to update

1. Action ID status (`planned` · `in_progress` · `blocked` · `done` · `wont_fix`)
2. Acceptance-criteria checklists (`- [ ]` / `- [x]`)
3. Dependency graphs / phase summaries
4. Last updated + revision notes

Never mark `done` for chat-only design. No private emails/phones/secrets in plan files.
